  i This event handler is written as an inline function instead of a method handler.
  
    4 │ </script>
    5 │ <template>
  > 6 │   <button @click="(event: Event) => save(event)" />
      │                   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
    7 │   <button @click="save(undefined as never)" />
    8 │ </template>
  
  i This project writes every event handler in the same style, so that templates are easier to read.
  
  i Use the name of the function as the handler, such as @click="save". Vue then passes the arguments of the event to the function, so check that the function expects them.
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  

